              <Paragraphs>
                <Paragraph>
                  <TextRuns>
                    <TextRun>
                      <Value>NOTE: Complete every line- leave no blanks. If the health institution does not provide a specific service, write "NS" ("No Service"). If the institution provides the service, but workload data are unavailable, write "NR" ("Not Recorded'). </Value>
                      <Style>
                        <FontStyle>Italic</FontStyle>
                        <FontSize>8pt</FontSize>
                      </Style>
                    </TextRun>
                  </TextRuns>
                  <Style />
                </Paragraph>
                <Paragraph>
                  <TextRuns>
                    <TextRun>
                      <Value>At the end of each month, this form should be completed in 2 copies and delivered by the 5th day of the following month. (January statistics should be posted by 5th February, February statistics by 5th March, and so forth) The copies should be distributed as follows:</Value>
                      <Style>
                        <FontStyle>Italic</FontStyle>
                        <FontSize>8pt</FontSize>
                      </Style>
                    </TextRun>
                  </TextRuns>
                  <Style />
                </Paragraph>
                <Paragraph>
                  <TextRuns>
                    <TextRun>
                      <Value>Original Form should be sent to the District Medical Records Office. The Copy Facility's should be Retained by the Facility's Records Office</Value>
                      <Style>
                        <FontStyle>Italic</FontStyle>
                        <FontSize>8pt</FontSize>
                      </Style>
                    </TextRun>
                  </TextRuns>
                  <Style />
                </Paragraph>
              </Paragraphs>
